{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "失联艺人与暴雨预警  (Unreachable Star and Orange Storm Alert)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Xingzi corners a sarcastic agent in the lobby trying to reach the travel show's lead star, a severe rainstorm alert hits Xingtian ahead of the live finale. Listen to their Mandarin dialogue.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是杏子吧？是你家老大让你过来找我的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没有，只是有些急事想联系一下贵公司的艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是他的手机关机了，家里电话也不接，想问您他近况还好吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "那你可问错人了，他现在可是大红人，谁管得着他呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "接什么通告、上什么戏都是他自己做决定，我可不知道他的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好，那麻烦您了，再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这人真是的，什么态度啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，林姐，大暴雨已经升级橙色预警了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们的应急预案得赶紧落实了，有备无患。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "快点动手吧，不能再等到明天了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "林姐，就照我说的办吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是杏子吧？是你家老大让你过来找我的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, right? Did your boss send you over to find me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没有，只是有些急事想联系一下贵公司的艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, we simply have an urgent matter and need to reach your artist.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是他的手机关机了，家里电话也不接，想问您他近况还好吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet his mobile is switched off and his home phone goes unanswered, so I wanted to ask if he is alright.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "那你可问错人了，他现在可是大红人，谁管得着他呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then you asked the wrong person—he is a huge star now, so who could possibly boss him around?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "接什么通告、上什么戏都是他自己做决定，我可不知道他的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which schedules or shows he takes is all his own call; I know nothing about his whereabouts.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好，那麻烦您了，再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright then, sorry to trouble you; goodbye.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这人真是的，什么态度啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, what kind of attitude was that!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，林姐，大暴雨已经升级橙色预警了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Lin Jie—the rainstorm has just been upgraded to an orange alert!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们的应急预案得赶紧落实了，有备无患。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We need to put our emergency plan into action right away—better safe than sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "快点动手吧，不能再等到明天了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry and get started; we cannot wait until tomorrow anymore!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "林姐，就照我说的办吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lin Jie, please go ahead and do just as I said!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
